OL,3,GNEWSARobert Kraft says Ed Sheeran asked
OL,4,Ahim to donate $2m in aid after
OL,5,AMacklemore backlash
OL,6,
OL,7,FRobert Kraft, the US stadium owner who
OL,8,Fhad pro-Palestinian rapper Macklemore
OL,9,Fremoved as Ed Sheeran's opening act at
OL,10,Fhis venue, says Sheeran has asked him
OL,11,Fto donate $2m (#1.5m) to "aid in the
OL,12,Fregion".
OL,14,FThe request came after Macklemore said
OL,15,Fhe would donate $1m (#750,000) to
OL,16,FPalestinian organisations, challenging
OL,17,FKraft to match the sum.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
