OL,3,GNEWSARobert Kraft says Ed Sheeran asked
OL,4,Ahim to donate $2m in aid after
OL,5,AMacklemore backlash
OL,6,
OL,7,FKraft, the owner of the New England
OL,8,FPatriots, announced the requested
OL,9,Fpledge in his second statement this
OL,10,Fweek on the controversy, without
OL,11,Fspecifying where exactly the funds
OL,12,Fwould go.
OL,14,FOn Monday, he confirmed he had
OL,15,FMacklemore dropped as the opening act
OL,16,Ffrom Sheeran's forthcoming performance
OL,17,Fat the Gillette Stadium near Boston,
OL,18,Faccusing the rapper of hate speech.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
